---
source: crates/dd-spec/tests/fixtures.rs
expression: "dd_spec::diag::render_plain(&report.diagnostics, &name, &src)"
input_file: spec/fixtures/invalid/35-L011-vid-only-match.yaml
---
DD-L011 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L011)

  ⚠ USB match uses only the vendor id; it would claim every product of that vendor
    ╭─[35-L011-vid-only-match.yaml:12:5]
 11 │   - bus: usb
 12 │     vid: 0x1209
    ·     ─┬─
    ·      ╰── too broad
 13 │ transport:
    ╰────
  help: add `pid` (and `interface_class` for vendor-specific interfaces) (spec §5.2)
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[35-L011-vid-only-match.yaml:39:1]
 38 │     timeout_ms: 50
 39 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 40 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
